{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"cpp-snippets","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.1.0","displayName":"C and C++ Snippets","description":"Main, classes, templates, smart pointers, loops and include guards.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Snippets"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"snippets":[{"language":"C / C++","path":"snippets/c-c.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"snippets/c-c.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Main (C++)\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"main\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"#include <iostream>\",\n      \"\",\n      \"int main() {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"\\treturn 0;\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"main with iostream\"\n  },\n  \"Main (C)\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"cmain\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"#include <stdio.h>\",\n      \"\",\n      \"int main(int argc, char **argv) {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"\\treturn 0;\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"main with stdio\"\n  },\n  \"Include guard\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"guard\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"#pragma once\",\n      \"\",\n      \"$0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A header guard\"\n  },\n  \"Class\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"class\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"class ${1:Name} {\",\n      \"public:\",\n      \"\\t${1:Name}();\",\n      \"\\t~${1:Name}();\",\n      \"\",\n      \"private:\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A class\"\n  },\n  \"Struct\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"struct\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"struct ${1:Name} {\",\n      \"\\t${2:int} ${3:field};\",\n      \"};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A struct\"\n  },\n  \"Template function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"tfn\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"template <typename ${1:T}>\",\n      \"${2:T} ${3:name}(${4:T} value) {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A function template\"\n  },\n  \"For loop\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"for\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"for (int ${1:i} = 0; ${1:i} < ${2:n}; ++${1:i}) {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A for loop\"\n  },\n  \"Range for\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rfor\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"for (const auto& ${1:item} : ${2:items}) {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A range-based for\"\n  },\n  \"Unique pointer\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"uptr\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"auto ${1:ptr} = std::make_unique<${2:Type}>(${3});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"make_unique\"\n  },\n  \"Shared pointer\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"sptr\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"auto ${1:ptr} = std::make_shared<${2:Type}>(${3});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"make_shared\"\n  },\n  \"Lambda\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"lam\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"[${1:&}](${2:int x}) {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A lambda\"\n  },\n  \"Cout\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"cout\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"std::cout << ${1:value} << \\\"\\\\\\\\n\\\";\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"std::cout\"\n  },\n  \"Printf\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"pf\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"printf(\\\"${1:%d}\\\\\\\\n\\\", ${2:value});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"printf\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# C and C++ Snippets\n\nMain, classes, templates, smart pointers, loops and include guards.\n\nType a prefix and press Tab. 13 snippets.\n\n| Language | Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| C / C++ | `main` | main with iostream |\n| C / C++ | `cmain` | main with stdio |\n| C / C++ | `guard` | A header guard |\n| C / C++ | `class` | A class |\n| C / C++ | `struct` | A struct |\n| C / C++ | `tfn` | A function template |\n| C / C++ | `for` | A for loop |\n| C / C++ | `rfor` | A range-based for |\n| C / C++ | `uptr` | make_unique |\n| C / C++ | `sptr` | make_shared |\n| C / C++ | `lam` | A lambda |\n| C / C++ | `cout` | std::cout |\n| C / C++ | `pf` | printf |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}